---
import { MARKET_PLAYERS, SITE_REGION } from '../lib/site';

const travel =
	SITE_REGION === 'ca'
		? 'If you travel between provinces for tournaments'
		: 'If you travel between states for tournaments';
---

<h2>Extra practical notes for {MARKET_PLAYERS}</h2>
<p>
	Club booking culture, shared carts, and mixed-skill round robins mean your gear has to work for
	imperfect warmups. Arrive with shoes that do not need a three-week break-in and a paddle you can
	dink with before your shoulder is hot. {travel}, pack a spare overgrip, and verify your portable
	net’s packed dimensions fit your trunk without crushing the frame.
</p>
<p>
	When friends ask for a single recommendation, answer with a question: what problem are you
	solving? Elbow fatigue, missing drops, slipping on dust, or hosting driveway games each point to
	different catalog picks. That question is the difference between a useful affiliate site and a
	keyword farm.
</p>
